{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01ToQEiVDhRRinAmTnx4L1JE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted data for every \"planned\" experiment in the experiment_plan, under the \"best\" tier scenario. Let me identify which experiments are still \"planned\" (not DONE/RUNNING).\n\nLooking through the experiment_plan, I see:\n\n1. exp-014 (status: planned) - Naturalistic validation on Common Crawl\n2. exp-009 (status: DONE, conclusion: failed) - but there are v3 versions that are DONE/success\n\nWait, let me re-read. The user says \"对 experiment_plan 中每个 planned 实验展开详细数据\". Let me check which ones have status \"planned\".\n\n\nScanning through the experiment list, most experiments are marked as DONE, but exp-014 stands out as the only one with \"planned\" status. Let me focus on generating the detailed predicted data for that one under the best-case scenario. Looking back at the task more carefully — the user wants detailed data for each planned experiment in the experiment_plan. The only one explicitly marked as \"planned\" is exp-014, but the RUNNING experiments from the registry (Mistral-7B Code, Qwen-7B Code, and the 32B C4 experiment) also need predictions since they don't have results yet. The Phase 1 definition mentions that both code experiments should confirm a ceiling of 2, which the best tier assumes. So I need to pull predictions for the incomplete experiments: exp-014 which is marked as planned, plus the three currently running experiments from the registry—the Mistral and Qwen code domain models, and the 32B variant. These aren't all listed in the original experiment plan, but they're active in the system and need predictions.\n\nLooking at the best tier assumptions, both code experiments confirm the ceiling holds at K*=2, and the domain ceiling framework is validating consistently across all the architecture families I've tested. Now I'm generating the detailed predictions, starting with Mistral-7B Code by examining what the existing code domain data shows—Qwen-1.5B and LLaMA-8B both hit K*=2 with similar AUC patterns, so I can use those as anchors for the Mistral model.\n\nMistral-7B performed differently across datasets: K*=1 on C4 but K*=3 on arXiv, which suggests the code pretraining is strong enough to support K*=2 in this best tier scenario. Given the expected range for the 1v2 AUC metric falls between 0.62 and 0.75, I'm settling on a prediction around 0.69—upper-middle of that range since Mistral has solid code capabilities, then I need to work through the JSD cliff pattern implications.\n\nFor Qwen-7B Code, the family consistency with Qwen-1.5B suggests K*=2 is appropriate. Since Qwen-1.5B Code achieved 0.7382 on the 1v2 metric and Qwen-7B is larger with better code generation, I'd expect something similar or slightly higher, so I'm predicting around 0.72 within the [0.65, 0.78] range.\n\nNow I'm moving into the Qwen2.5-32B C4 analysis to confirm the K* pattern.\n\nLooking at the C4 results across model sizes, there's a slight downward trend as models get larger—Qwen-1.5B at 0.6262, Qwen-7B at 0.6178, Qwen-14B at 0.6210, and LLaMA-8B at 0.6123. This suggests larger models generate higher quality text, which actually lowers the 1v2 metric. For the 32B model, I'd expect this trend to continue, predicting around 0.615.\n\nFor the naturalistic validation experiment, I'm working with a Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot and expecting the depth distribution to correlate with AlignScore and vocabulary richness.\n\nNow I need to structure the full YAML output with all planned experiments clearly defined.\n\nI should double-check which experiments actually need predictions—exp-009 is marked done but failed, though the v3 versions succeeded, so those should cover it. The ones still pending are exp-014, exp_code_mistral7b, exp_code_qwen7b, and exp_32b_c4.\n\nFor each experiment, I need to include the name, plan_id, description, expected results with specific numbers, rationale for why those results occur, tables, figures, and analysis approach. Let me be thorough with the predictions, especially for the best-case scenarios.\n\nStarting with exp_code_mistral7b—Mistral-7B has decent code training background, unlike some other models.  On C4 it showed K*=1 but on arXiv it was K*=3, and since code is intermediate complexity like C4, Mistral's code pretraining should let it hit the ceiling around 0.68 for 1v2 AUC with a clear JSD cliff dropping to 0.52-0.54 for 2v3. For exp_code_qwen7b, Qwen-7B is from the same family as Qwen-1.5B but with stronger code capabilities—given that Qwen-1.5B Code hit 0.7382 on 1v2, I'd expect Qwen-7B around 0.72 with similar 2v3 collapse to 0.53. Now for exp_32b_c4, this is the largest model variant I need to predict.\n\nOn C4 the trend shows 1v2 AUC slightly decreases with scale as generation quality improves and becomes harder to distinguish—1.5B was 0.626, 7B was 0.618, 14B was 0.621, so 32B should land around 0.615 with K*=2 confirmed. For exp-014 using Common Crawl, I'm expecting moderate correlation between predicted depth and vocabulary richness, with most content clustering around depth 0-1, though this part is more qualitative. Now I need to write out the YAML with comprehensive tables and figures, and I should include cross-scorer validation for the Code experiments as part of the domain ceiling framework validation.\n\nLooking at the key metrics for the best tier, I'm seeing 4 models at ceiling across 5 categories—Qwen-1.5B, LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B, and Qwen-7B, while Pythia stays at K*=1 due to code competence limitations. The 1v2 AUC ranges are 0.62-0.75 for Mistral-7B (best at 0.69) and 0.65-0.78 for Qwen-7B (best at 0.72), with domain ceiling clean fit around 92-98% (targeting 96%) and cross-scorer K* preservation rate between 0.85-0.95 (aiming for 0.92).\n\nNow I'm looking at the performance deltas and publication metrics—the HellaSwag delta is already measured at 3.8-6.1 perplexity points, estimated reviewer excitement sits at 3.8-4.2 with a best estimate of 4.1, and the EMNLP main track acceptance probability ranges from 0.55-0.75 with 0.70 as the target. I need to decide whether the Mistral-7B and Qwen-7B code experiments require separate cross-scorer validation runs, since the registry shows some code experiments are already running while others have cross-scorer variants for arXiv and Code domains.\n\nWriting YAML configuration... Looking at the performance metrics for Mistral-7B across the code domain—the AUC scores show a sharp drop-off after depth 1-2, with Jensen-Shannon divergence stabilizing at very low values, and the ordinal metrics confirming that while the model achieves K*=2 in code generation, it struggles with web text domains where K*=1. Mistral 的 code generation 质量足以达到 ceiling，但每次生成的信息损失略大于 Qwen 家族。JSD cliff 在 1v2 到 2v3 的崩塌幅度（11.1 倍）与 Qwen-1.5B Code 的模式一致，这证实了 code 域特有的 JSD 动态。现在我在查看 Mistral-7B 在 code 配对上的 AUC 指标和置信区间。 Generating markdown table...\n\nI'm looking at the JSD cliff patterns across these five models—four of them show that dramatic >10x collapse right at the code domain transition from 1v2 to 2v3, which is a distinctive feature of the code benchmark, while Pythia doesn't exhibit this sharp cliff. Then I'm comparing Mistral-7B's K* values across the three domains to show how it creates this perfect ascending pattern: K*=1 on C4 indicating insufficient web text competence, K*=2 on code where it's fully capable, and K*=3 on arXiv where academic text demands more.\n\nThis single model's K* progression across domains is the strongest evidence for the domain ceiling framework—it demonstrates that K* isn't a model limitation but entirely determined by the interaction between domain structure and the model's domain-specific competence. The Mistral result on C4 isn't a fundamental model constraint; it's a gap in domain-specific capability.\n\nNow I'm planning an experiment with Qwen2.5-7B to test whether the code domain K*=2 holds consistently within the same model family when scaled up, using prompt-chain depth generation across depths 0-5.\n\nLooking at the performance metrics for Qwen-7B in the code domain, I can see the pairwise AUC scores declining sharply from 0.94 down to around 0.51 by depth 4-5, while the Jensen-Shannon divergence flattens out, suggesting the model reaches a saturation point. The ordinal metrics show moderate accuracy at 0.355 with a mean absolute error of 1.19, confirming the K*=2 hypothesis for this model-domain pair.\n\nThe analysis shows that while Qwen-7B's larger scale improves code generation quality compared to the 1.5B variant—producing more natural syntax and richer API usage—this doesn't extend the depth ceiling, which appears constrained by the domain structure itself rather than model capacity. The slightly lower 1v2 AUC relative to Qwen-1.5B Code reflects how the 7B's superior generation quality narrows the gap between depth-1 and depth-2 outputs, making them more similar to the original, though still well above the 0.60 threshold. The JSD cliff ratio shows a dramatic 12.3x increase, consistent with the pattern observed in the smaller model.\n\nGenerating markdown table... The Qwen-7B results in the Code domain confirm scale invariance within the family—both models show K*=2, matching the C4 domain pattern. What's crucial is that Qwen-7B now consistently has K*=2 across both C4 and Code domains, with K*=3 on arXiv, perfectly aligning with the domain ceiling hypothesis. This rules out the possibility that Qwen-1.5B's K*=2 in Code is just a small-model artifact. Now I'm moving to validate the 32B model on C4 data. Looking at the bootstrap confidence intervals and performance metrics, the results confirm that K*=2 holds consistently at the 32B scale. The 1v2 AUC of around 0.615 aligns closely with what we saw at 14B (0.621), suggesting that the domain structure of C4 web text—with its homogeneous content and low structural complexity—sets a ceiling that model scale doesn't overcome.\n\nThe slight decrease in 0v1 AUC at 32B (0.949 versus the 0.97-0.99 range for smaller models) makes sense because larger models generate text closer to human quality, which weakens the binary detection signal slightly, though it remains extremely strong. This extends our evidence base from the 1B-14B range up to 32B, reinforcing the core finding that domain structure, not model capability, determines the K* ceiling.\n\nGenerating markdown table... Generating markdown table... 这解决了审稿人关于小模型局限性的担忧，强化了 K* 作为数据集固有属性而非模型特定现象的论点。接下来我需要在自然的 Common Crawl 数据上验证这个方法，通过预测深度并与 AlignScore 和词汇丰富度指标进行关联分析，看看 K* 感知的深度估计在真实网络数据中的表现如何。\n\n现在我在查看这些关联的具体数值——深度与核心性呈负相关，与词汇丰富度也呈负相关，而 AlignScore 和词汇丰富度之间有中等正相关，分类器对深度 0 的预测最有信心，但对更深层次的预测信心逐渐下降，同时 Common Crawl 中合成内容的比例在上升。\n\n这些模式反映了生成内容随着递归深度增加而出现语义漂移和词汇多样性衰减，但相关性并非特别强，因为网络爬虫数据跨越多个领域，不同领域的特征表现差异很大。\n\n从2025到2026年，合成内容的占比上升了6个百分点，说明LLM生成的内容在网络上持续增长。分类器在识别深度≥2的内容时置信度较低（0.39），这与信息论预期一致——当区分信号接近饱和时，模型的判别能力就会下降。\n\nGenerating markdown table... The key insight is that naturalistic validation isn't about proving depth prediction accuracy in the wild—that's impossible without ground truth—but rather showing that predicted depth aligns with independent quality metrics and that the distribution matches the information-theoretic prediction of K*=2, where content beyond depth 2 becomes rare and classifier confidence drops sharply. The moderate correlation around -0.3 makes sense given these realistic constraints.\n\nNow I'm reconsidering the model selection criteria. Looking at the ceiling thresholds, I need to check which models hit the target range. With Qwen-1.5B, LLaMA-8B, and Pythia-1.4B currently at K*=2, K*=2, and K*=1 respectively, adding Mistral-7B and Qwen-7B both at K*=2 would give me four models at the ceiling, which fits the specified range. Pythia stays at K*=1, so the best tier would be 4.\n\nFor the cross-scorer preservation rate in the Code domain, I'm checking whether K* values remain stable across different scorers. The experiments show consistent preservation—Qwen-1.5B scored by Pythia maintains K*=2, and the LLaMA and Pythia results from the reference also preserve their K* values, suggesting the metric is robust across scorer variations.\n\nNow I'm finalizing the YAML structure, but I need to clarify what counts as \"planned\" versus what's already running or in the registry. Looking at the experiment_plan section, only exp-001 through exp-028 and mvp-001 are formally listed. The Code experiments (exp_code_mistral7b, exp_code_qwen7b) and exp_32b_c4 exist in the registry but aren't in the official plan, so I should be precise about which experiments are actually planned versus in progress.\n\nActually, given that Phase 1's best tier definition centers on Code domain experiments, I think the user wants predictions for all experiments without final results yet—whether they're formally planned or already running. So I'll include exp-014 from the plan plus the three Code experiments currently in the registry.\n\nLet me verify the existing Code domain performance data to establish the baseline for my predictions. Looking at the performance metrics across these models, I notice the Code domain shows a stronger signal in the 1v2 boundary compared to C4, even though both have the same ceiling. The JSD cliff appears at different positions between domains. Based on this pattern, I'd estimate Mistral-7B Code should score around 0.68 on the 1v2 AUC—lower than the Qwen/LLaMA range but still solidly above 0.60—while Qwen-7B Code, being a larger variant of the 1.5B model, should land near 0.72. Now I'll compile the final YAML predictions and check whether cross-scorer validation experiments are planned for the new Code models. The best tier mentions cross_scorer_kstar_preservation_rate: [0.85, 0.95]. This is an aggregate metric across all cross-scorer experiments. With the new Code experiments, we'd need to verify this.\n\nBut the user asked specifically for \"experiment_plan 中每个 planned 实验\"—the experiments that are planned/running but don't have results yet. Let me stick with the four I identified.\n\nNow I'm checking whether my predicted numbers align with the metric ranges that define the best tier. Looking at the code model performance metrics, my predictions for the 1v2 AUC scores fall within the expected ranges, and the domain ceiling fit percentage should land around 96% given that four out of five Code models hit the ceiling. The cross-scorer preservation rate is already established, and the HellaSwag delta is already measured.\n\nFor the 32B experiment specifically, I'm examining the trend in 0v1 AUC across different model sizes on C4 data—as models get larger, they generate more human-like text, so the AUC decreases. The progression from smaller models like Pythia-1.4B and OLMo-1B down through the larger ones shows this pattern clearly, and I'm trying to extrapolate where Qwen-32B would fall in this trend.\n\nLooking at just the Qwen family to avoid confounding factors like LLaMA's different generation style, the 0v1 AUC drops from 0.987 at 1.5B to around 0.960-0.964 at 7B and 14B, so I'd estimate Qwen-32B at roughly 0.950. For the 1v2 AUC metric, the values stay relatively stable across the Qwen models in the 0.615-0.626 range, so I'd expect the 32B to maintain that same level around 0.615.\n\nNow I'm ready to compile the final YAML output with these predictions.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54151,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":54151},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aa62e77c-2cca-4d36-acc6-65f0c92a196e","uuid":"1daadc61-c32d-456a-966e-1580dc7539ac"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01ToQEiVDhRRinAmTnx4L1JE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。Code 域 Mistral-7B 和 Qwen-7B 均确认 ceiling=2（4/5 domain-competent 模型，\n  仅 Pythia-1.4B 因 code pretraining 不足 K*=1，与 Mistral C4 K*=1 同属 competence failure 模式）。\n  32B 进一步确认 C4 K*=2 不随 scale 变化。Domain ceiling 框架在 4 域 × 6 架构族上无例外成立——\n  所有 \"异常\" 均可被 (domain structure sets ceiling, model competence modulates actual K*) 统一解释。\n  标题级结论：\"K*∈{1,2,3} forming a domain hierarchy — Wiki=1, C4=Code=2, arXiv=3\"。\n  Code 域的加入将 modality 覆盖从 natural language 扩展至 code，4 域覆盖+6 架构族交叉验证\n  构成 EMNLP Main 级别的 empirical evidence。One-wash laundering + domain ceiling 作为\n  memorable takeaway。Claims 无需调整。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B Code Domain Depth Chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_code_mistral7b\"\n    description: >\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 在 Code/Python 域的 prompt-chain depth generation (depth 0-5),\n      scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。验证 Code domain ceiling=2 是否跨 Mistral 架构族成立。\n      核心假设：Mistral 的 code pretraining 赋予其足够的 code domain competence 达到 ceiling=2，\n      尽管其在 C4 上 K*=1。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9485\n        1v2: 0.6893\n        2v3: 0.5274\n        3v4: 0.5121\n        4v5: 0.5058\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0045\n        1v2: 0.0098\n        2v3: 0.0112\n        3v4: 0.0095\n        4v5: 0.0078\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.0718\n        1v2: 0.0392\n        2v3: 0.0035\n        3v4: 0.0028\n        4v5: 0.0026\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {ci_lower: 0.9421, ci_upper: 0.9549, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {ci_lower: 0.6712, ci_upper: 0.7074, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {ci_lower: 0.5139, ci_upper: 0.5409, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {ci_lower: 0.4992, ci_upper: 0.5250, perm_p: 0.0124}\n        4v5: {ci_lower: 0.4947, ci_upper: 0.5169, perm_p: 0.0893}\n      jsd_cliff_ratio_1v2_to_2v3: 11.2\n      ordinal_mae: 1.218\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.349\n      top_features: [freq_entropy, surp_d1_mean, surp_d2_mean, surp_std, surp_d1_skew]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B 在 C4 上 K*=1（web text domain competence 不足，one-wash），在 arXiv 上 K*=3\n      （academic text competence 充分达 ceiling）。Code 域 ceiling=2，而 Mistral 系列在 code\n      benchmarks 上表现强劲（HumanEval ~30-40%），其 code pretraining 数据充分赋予 Code domain\n      competence，使其能达到 ceiling=2。这是 domain ceiling 框架的关键预测：同一模型在三个域给出\n      三个不同 K*（C4=1, Code=2, arXiv=3），完美映射 domain hierarchy。\n\n      1v2 AUC ~0.69 的具体水平理据：(1) 高于 C4 域的 ~0.59（Code 域的结构化特征——syntax trees,\n      indentation, API patterns——提供更强的 generation-distinguishing signal），(2) 略低于\n      Qwen-1.5B Code(0.738) 和 LLaMA-8B Code(0.739)——Mistral 的 code generation 足够好以达\n      ceiling，但其 web text training emphasis 使得 code-specific depth signal 略弱于\n      code-specialized 模型；(3) CI lower=0.671 远超 θ=0.60，判定 robust。\n\n      JSD cliff 在 1v2→2v3（0.039→0.0035, 11.2x collapse）与 Qwen-1.5B Code(11.7x) 和\n      LLaMA-8B Code(13.5x) 一致，确认 Code 域特有的 cliff 位置——不同于 C4 的 0v1→1v2 cliff，\n      说明 domain structure 不仅决定 K* 值还影响信号衰减模式。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Mistral-7B Code Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap CI\"\n        content: |\n          | Pair | AUC    | 95% CI          | > θ=0.60?  | JSD     | perm_p |\n          |------|--------|-----------------|------------|---------|--------|\n          | 0v1  | 0.9485 | [0.942, 0.955]  | ✅         | 0.0718  | <0.001 |\n          | 1v2  | 0.6893 | [0.671, 0.707]  | ✅ +7.1pp  | 0.0392  | <0.001 |\n          | 2v3  | 0.5274 | [0.514, 0.541]  | ❌         | 0.0035  | <0.001 |\n          | 3v4  | 0.5121 | [0.499, 0.525]  | ❌         | 0.0028  | 0.012  |\n          | 4v5  | 0.5058 | [0.495, 0.517]  | ❌         | 0.0026  | 0.089  |\n      - title: \"Code Domain Cross-Model Summary (updated with Mistral-7B)\"\n        content: |\n          | Model       | Family   | K* | 1v2 AUC | JSD cliff ratio | Code competent? |\n          |-------------|----------|----|---------|-----------------|-----------------|\n          | Qwen-1.5B   | Qwen     | 2  | 0.7382  | 11.7x           | ✅               |\n          | LLaMA-8B    | LLaMA    | 2  | 0.7394  | 13.5x           | ✅               |\n          | Mistral-7B  | Mistral  | 2  | 0.6893  | 11.2x           | ✅               |\n          | Qwen-7B     | Qwen     | 2  | 0.7223  | 12.3x           | ✅ (predicted)   |\n          | Pythia-1.4B | GPT-NeoX | 1  | 0.5983  | 2.2x            | ❌ (The Pile)    |\n      - title: \"Mistral-7B Cross-Domain K* Ladder\"\n        content: |\n          | Domain  | K*  | 1v2 AUC | Domain Ceiling | Competence? |\n          |---------|-----|---------|----------------|-------------|\n          | C4      | 1   | 0.5935  | 2              | ❌ (one-wash)|\n          | Code    | 2   | 0.6893  | 2              | ✅           |\n          | arXiv   | 3   | 0.6275  | 3              | ✅           |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Mistral-7B cross-domain K* bar chart: 三柱图 C4(K*=1), Code(K*=2), arXiv(K*=3)，完美阶梯。Domain ceiling 用虚线标注，Mistral 在 C4 未达 ceiling 用不同色标。\"\n      - \"Code domain JSD cliff overlay: 5 个模型的 log(JSD) vs depth pair 曲线叠加，4/5 在 1v2→2v3 呈 >10x collapse，Pythia 无明显 cliff。\"\n      - \"Code 1v2 AUC distribution: 5 个模型的 bootstrap AUC distribution violin plot，4 个的整体分布在 θ=0.60 上方，Pythia 跨越 θ 线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mistral-7B Code K*=2 是 domain ceiling 框架的决定性证据之一。它提供了论文中最强的单模型\n      cross-domain argument：同一模型在三个域分别给出 K*={1,2,3}，完美对应域复杂度阶梯。C4\n      上的 one-wash (K*=1) 不是 model-level limitation——它是 domain-specific competence gap\n      在 domain ceiling 框架下的自然结果。Code 域的 code pretraining \"rescue\" Mistral from\n      one-wash，正如 arXiv 的结构化特征 \"rescue\" 所有 domain-competent 模型至 K*=3。\n\n      具体对论文的意义：(1) Mistral 成为唯一跨三个 K* 值的模型，极具说服力；(2) Code 域\n      现在有 3 个架构族（Qwen, LLaMA, Mistral）确认 ceiling=2，加上 Pythia 的 competence\n      failure，构成完整的 domain ceiling 叙事；(3) 1v2 AUC=0.689 虽低于 Qwen/LLaMA 的\n      ~0.74，但 CI lower=0.671 远超 θ，判定 unambiguous。\n\n  - name: \"Qwen-7B Code Domain Depth Chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_code_qwen7b\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B 在 Code/Python 域的 prompt-chain depth generation (depth 0-5),\n      scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。验证同家族 scale-up 后 Code K*=2 一致性，排除 Qwen-1.5B Code\n      结果是 small-model artifact 的可能。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9401\n        1v2: 0.7223\n        2v3: 0.5312\n        3v4: 0.5088\n        4v5: 0.5047\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0052\n        1v2: 0.0089\n        2v3: 0.0103\n        3v4: 0.0087\n        4v5: 0.0071\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.0748\n        1v2: 0.0418\n        2v3: 0.0034\n        3v4: 0.0027\n        4v5: 0.0024\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {ci_lower: 0.9325, ci_upper: 0.9477, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {ci_lower: 0.7048, ci_upper: 0.7398, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {ci_lower: 0.5175, ci_upper: 0.5449, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {ci_lower: 0.4968, ci_upper: 0.5208, perm_p: 0.0341}\n        4v5: {ci_lower: 0.4943, ci_upper: 0.5151, perm_p: 0.1206}\n      jsd_cliff_ratio_1v2_to_2v3: 12.3\n      ordinal_mae: 1.193\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.356\n      top_features: [freq_entropy, surp_d1_mean, surp_d2_mean, surp_std, surp_d1_skew]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-7B 与 Qwen-1.5B 同属 Qwen 家族，code generation 能力随 scale 提升（Qwen2.5-7B\n      在 HumanEval 上显著优于 1.5B）。域 ceiling=2 由 Code 的 domain structure 设定，不受\n      model scale 影响——这已在 C4 域的 Qwen-1.5B(K*=2) vs Qwen-7B(K*=2) 上验证。\n\n      1v2 AUC ~0.722 的水平理据：(1) 与 Qwen-1.5B Code(0.738) 接近但略低——7B 的更强 code\n      generation（更自然的语法、更准确的 API 使用、更好的 variable naming）使 depth-1 vs depth-2\n      的差异略微缩小（第一代生成已更接近 original），但 K* boundary 信号仍充分；(2) 与 LLaMA-8B\n      Code(0.739) 和 Mistral-7B Code(predicted 0.689) 处于同一量级，但反映 Qwen 家族在\n      code 上的更强 competence（vs Mistral 的相对弱势）；(3) CI lower=0.705 远超 θ=0.60。\n\n      JSD cliff 12.3x（0.042→0.0034）与 family 内 Qwen-1.5B(11.7x) 一致，确认 cliff\n      position 是 domain property 而非 model property。0v1 AUC=0.940 低于 Qwen-1.5B(0.939)\n      是噪声范围内——同家族 cross-scorer 评分下 0v1 高度稳定。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Qwen-7B Code Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap CI\"\n        content: |\n          | Pair | AUC    | 95% CI          | > θ=0.60?  | JSD     | perm_p |\n          |------|--------|-----------------|------------|---------|--------|\n          | 0v1  | 0.9401 | [0.933, 0.948]  | ✅         | 0.0748  | <0.001 |\n          | 1v2  | 0.7223 | [0.705, 0.740]  | ✅ +10.5pp | 0.0418  | <0.001 |\n          | 2v3  | 0.5312 | [0.518, 0.545]  | ❌         | 0.0034  | <0.001 |\n          | 3v4  | 0.5088 | [0.497, 0.521]  | ❌         | 0.0027  | 0.034  |\n          | 4v5  | 0.5047 | [0.494, 0.515]  | ❌         | 0.0024  | 0.121  |\n      - title: \"Qwen Family Code Domain Scale Invariance\"\n        content: |\n          | Model     | Scale | K* | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | JSD cliff | Δ1v2 vs 1.5B |\n          |-----------|-------|----|---------|---------|-----------|--------------|\n          | Qwen-1.5B | 1.5B  | 2  | 0.7382  | 0.5300  | 11.7x     | baseline     |\n          | Qwen-7B   | 7B    | 2  | 0.7223  | 0.5312  | 12.3x     | -1.6pp       |\n      - title: \"Qwen-7B Cross-Domain Consistency\"\n        content: |\n          | Domain | K* | 1v2 AUC | Domain Ceiling | Consistent? |\n          |--------|----|---------|----------------|-------------|\n          | C4     | 2  | 0.6178  | 2              | ✅ (at ceiling) |\n          | Code   | 2  | 0.7223  | 2              | ✅ (at ceiling) |\n          | arXiv  | 3  | 0.6255  | 3              | ✅ (at ceiling) |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Qwen 1.5B vs 7B Code AUC curve overlay: 两条曲线几乎重叠，K* boundary 位置完全一致，展示 scale invariance。\"\n      - \"Qwen-7B cross-domain grouped bar chart: C4, Code, arXiv 三域的 pairwise AUC 并排展示，Code 与 C4 同 K*=2 但 1v2 AUC 更高。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen-7B Code K*=2 提供两重证据：(1) 同家族 scale invariance——1.5B 和 7B 在 Code 域\n      K* 完全一致，1v2 AUC 差异仅 1.6pp（噪声范围），确认 K* 不是 small-model artifact；\n      (2) 单模型跨域一致性——Qwen-7B 在 C4(K*=2), Code(K*=2), arXiv(K*=3) 三域均达到\n      domain ceiling，是 domain ceiling 框架的另一个完美案例。\n\n      Code 域 1v2 AUC(0.722) 显著高于 C4 域(0.618)，尽管两者 K*=2。这反映 Code 的\n      结构化特征（syntax, indentation）在 depth-1 vs depth-2 的辨别力更强，但仍在\n      depth-2 之后饱和。这一差异进一步证明 JSD cliff position 和 signal strength 是\n      domain-dependent 的，即使 K* 相同。\n\n  - name: \"Qwen2.5-32B C4 Scale Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_32b_c4\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-32B 在 C4 web text 上的 depth chain generation (depth 0-5),\n      scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。将 C4 域的 model scale coverage 从 1B-14B 扩展至 32B，\n      验证 K*=2 不随 scale 变化的核心论点。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9487\n        1v2: 0.6152\n        2v3: 0.5438\n        3v4: 0.5192\n        4v5: 0.5108\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0042\n        1v2: 0.0078\n        2v3: 0.0065\n        3v4: 0.0091\n        4v5: 0.0072\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.0965\n        1v2: 0.0096\n        2v3: 0.0055\n        3v4: 0.0040\n        4v5: 0.0032\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {ci_lower: 0.9422, ci_upper: 0.9552, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {ci_lower: 0.6058, ci_upper: 0.6246, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {ci_lower: 0.5341, ci_upper: 0.5535, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {ci_lower: 0.5069, ci_upper: 0.5315, perm_p: 0.0008}\n        4v5: {ci_lower: 0.5003, ci_upper: 0.5213, perm_p: 0.0321}\n      ordinal_mae: 1.239\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.347\n      top_features: [freq_entropy, surp_d1_skew, surp_std, surp_d1_mean, surp_d2_mean]\n    result_rationale: >\n      C4 域 K*=2 已在 8 个 model configurations（1B-14B, 5 architectures）中确认。32B\n      延续这一模式的机制性理由：\n\n      (1) K* ceiling 由 C4 web text 的 domain structure 设定——C4 是 homogeneous web crawl\n      数据，缺乏 arXiv 那样的结构化标记（LaTeX, citations）提供额外 depth signal。Domain\n      structure 不因 model scale 改变，因此 ceiling=2 持续成立。\n\n      (2) 1v2 AUC ~0.615 处于已观测范围 [0.611, 0.654] 内。Qwen 家族 C4 数据：\n      1.5B=0.626, 7B=0.618, 14B=0.621——无系统 scale 趋势，32B 预计类似。略低于 1.5B 是\n      因为更大模型的 generation 更 \"natural\"（词汇分布、perplexity 更接近 human text），\n      depth-1 vs depth-2 的特征差异略微缩小，但 domain ceiling 确保信号仍在 θ 以上。\n\n      (3) 0v1 AUC ~0.949——随 scale 增大 binary detection 信号缓慢减弱（Qwen 系列：\n      1.5B=0.987, 7B=0.964, 14B=0.960, 32B≈0.949），但仍极强。这反映 larger models 的\n      generation 更接近 human text（0v1 gap 缩小），但这是 binary detection 的变化，\n      不影响 K* boundary pair 的判定。\n\n      (4) CI lower=0.606 > θ=0.60，marginally robust（~0.6pp headroom），与 Qwen-1.5B\n      cont(CI lower=0.602) 和 LLaMA-8B(CI lower=0.603) 类似——C4 域 boundary pair 信号\n      本身就在 θ 附近，这是 domain structure 的固有特征而非统计 weakness。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Qwen2.5-32B C4 Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap CI\"\n        content: |\n          | Pair | AUC    | 95% CI          | > θ=0.60?  | JSD     | perm_p |\n          |------|--------|-----------------|------------|---------|--------|\n          | 0v1  | 0.9487 | [0.942, 0.955]  | ✅         | 0.0965  | <0.001 |\n          | 1v2  | 0.6152 | [0.606, 0.625]  | ✅ +0.6pp  | 0.0096  | <0.001 |\n          | 2v3  | 0.5438 | [0.534, 0.554]  | ❌         | 0.0055  | <0.001 |\n          | 3v4  | 0.5192 | [0.507, 0.532]  | ❌         | 0.0040  | <0.001 |\n          | 4v5  | 0.5108 | [0.500, 0.521]  | ❌         | 0.0032  | 0.032  |\n      - title: \"C4 Domain K* across Full Model Scale Range (1B-32B)\"\n        content: |\n          | Model       | Scale | Family   | K* | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | 0v1 AUC |\n          |-------------|-------|----------|----|---------|----------|---------|\n          | OLMo-1B     | 1B    | OLMo     | 2  | 0.6145  | 0.6045   | 0.997   |\n          | Pythia-1.4B | 1.4B  | GPT-NeoX | 2  | 0.6539  | 0.6454   | 0.993   |\n          | Qwen-1.5B   | 1.5B  | Qwen     | 2  | 0.6262  | 0.6168   | 0.987   |\n          | Qwen-7B     | 7B    | Qwen     | 2  | 0.6178  | 0.6079   | 0.964   |\n          | LLaMA-8B    | 8B    | LLaMA    | 2  | 0.6123  | 0.6028   | 0.923   |\n          | Mistral-7B  | 7B    | Mistral  | 1  | 0.5935  | 0.5835   | 0.984   |\n          | Qwen-14B    | 14B   | Qwen     | 2  | 0.6210  | 0.6119   | 0.960   |\n          | Qwen-32B    | 32B   | Qwen     | 2  | 0.6152  | 0.6058   | 0.949   |\n      - title: \"Scale Trend: 0v1 AUC Decay\"\n        content: |\n          | Scale bucket | Mean 0v1 AUC | Mean 1v2 AUC | K* |\n          |-------------|-------------|-------------|-----|\n          | 1-1.5B      | 0.992       | 0.631       | 2   |\n          | 7-8B        | 0.957       | 0.614       | 2*  |\n          | 14-32B      | 0.954       | 0.618       | 2   |\n          * Mistral excluded (K*=1, competence failure)\n    figures_description:\n      - \"log(params) vs 1v2 AUC scatter: 水平线 θ=0.60，所有点（除 Mistral）在 θ 上方，1v2 AUC 无系统 scale 趋势（r²<0.05），论证 K* 是 domain property。\"\n      - \"log(params) vs 0v1 AUC scatter: 缓慢负趋势，从 ~0.99(1B) 到 ~0.95(32B)，标注 '32B generation 更接近 human text，但 binary detection 仍 trivial (AUC>0.94)'。\"\n      - \"32B 的 pairwise AUC 曲线与 14B overlay: 几乎完全重叠，1v2 几乎相同。\"\n    analysis: >\n      32B 结果将 C4 K*=2 的 model scale coverage 从 14B 推至 32B（覆盖 1B-32B, 32x\n      scale range），是回应审稿人 concern \"只基于小模型\" 的直接证据。1v2 AUC=0.615\n      在已观测范围内，CI lower=0.606 > θ=0.60，K*=2 判定成立但 marginal（这是 C4 域\n      的固有特征，不是统计问题）。\n\n      0v1 AUC 的 scale decay（0.997→0.949 across 1B-32B）是有趣的附带发现：larger\n      models 的 first-generation text 更接近 human text，binary detection 逐渐变难。\n      但关键是这不影响 K*——1v2 boundary pair 的信号不随 scale 系统变化。这一解耦\n      进一步支持 K* 由 domain structure 决定的论点。\n\n      对论文的意义：scale coverage 扩展到 32B 后，\"仅限小模型\" 的 concern 大幅\n      缓解。DPI 理论保证 K* 对任意规模存在，实证覆盖 1B-32B 是 reasonable empirical\n      support。70B+ 可留为 future work。\n\n  - name: \"Naturalistic Common Crawl Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 随机样本做 depth prediction，与 AlignScore\n      和独立 vocabulary richness (type-token ratio, hapax legomena ratio) 做 correlation。\n      验证 K*-aware depth estimation 在无 ground truth 的野外数据上的行为合理性。\n    expected_results:\n      n_documents: 50000\n      depth_distribution:\n        predicted_depth_0_pct: 61.8\n        predicted_depth_1_pct: 25.3\n        predicted_depth_2_pct: 9.7\n        predicted_depth_3_plus_pct: 3.2\n      correlations:\n        alignscore_vs_predicted_depth:\n          spearman_rho: -0.312\n          p_value: \"<1e-50\"\n          interpretation: \"deeper generations show lower semantic coherence\"\n        vocab_richness_ttr_vs_predicted_depth:\n          spearman_rho: -0.274\n          p_value: \"<1e-40\"\n          interpretation: \"vocabulary diversity decreases with generation depth\"\n        hapax_ratio_vs_predicted_depth:\n          spearman_rho: -0.238\n          p_value: \"<1e-30\"\n          interpretation: \"rare word usage decreases with depth\"\n        alignscore_vs_ttr:\n          spearman_rho: 0.441\n          p_value: \"<1e-80\"\n      classifier_confidence_by_depth:\n        depth_0_mean_prob: 0.724\n        depth_1_mean_prob: 0.481\n        depth_2_mean_prob: 0.387\n        depth_3_plus_mean_prob: 0.328\n      temporal_comparison:\n        cc_2025_jan_synthetic_pct: 34.2\n        cc_2026_jan_synthetic_pct: 41.5\n        delta_pp: 7.3\n      domain_breakdown:\n        news_sites_depth0_pct: 52.1\n        blog_forums_depth0_pct: 58.4\n        tech_docs_depth0_pct: 71.3\n        social_media_depth0_pct: 43.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Common Crawl 的野外 depth 分布预测基于以下推理链：\n\n      (1) Depth 分布呈重尾递减（~62% depth-0, ~25% depth-1, ~10% depth-2, ~3% depth-3+）。\n      理由：web 上 LLM-generated content 的主要来源是 single-pass generation（SEO content,\n      chatbot responses, AI writing assistants），这些对应 depth-1。真正的递归生成（AI 生成\n      内容被再次用于 AI 生成）较少发生——需要特定 pipeline（如 synthetic data augmentation\n      循环），且多数此类 pipeline 不超过 2-3 轮。Depth-0 仍占主体（>60%）反映 web 上\n      human-written content 的持续主导地位。\n\n      (2) AlignScore 与 predicted depth 的中等负相关（ρ~-0.31）。理由：generation 过程中\n      的 information loss 导致语义漂移——deeper generations 偏离 original 主题、引入\n      hallucinations、丢失 nuanced arguments。但相关性只是中等，因为：(a) CC 是多域混合，\n      不同域的 K* 不同，depth 预测器在 wiki-like 内容上有 K*=1 限制；(b) 低质量 human\n      text（depth-0 但 AlignScore 低）和高质量 AI text（depth-1 但 AlignScore 高）\n      产生噪声；(c) depth 预测器可能在 OOD 域上 miscalibrate。\n\n      (3) Vocabulary richness 与 depth 的负相关（ρ~-0.27）。理由：model collapse 的\n      微观表征——recursive generation 收敛 vocabulary distribution，减少 rare words\n      (hapax legomena)，降低 type-token ratio。这是 information-theoretic 的必然结果\n      (DPI)，但在单文档粒度上信号较弱。\n\n      (4) 分类器置信度随 depth 骤降（0.72→0.48→0.39→0.33）。理由：K*=2 的信息论预期\n      ——depth-0 判定高置信（binary detection trivial），depth-1 中等置信（仍有明确\n      generation artifact），depth-2 低置信（接近 K* boundary，信号饱和），depth-3+\n      极低置信（beyond K*, 实质是随机猜测）。\n\n      (5) Temporal trend（+7.3pp synthetic, 2025→2026）。理由：LLM 使用持续增长，\n      AI-generated content 在 web 上的占比逐年上升，与 industry reports 一致。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Common Crawl Predicted Depth Distribution\"\n        content: |\n          | Predicted Depth | Proportion | Mean Classifier Conf | AlignScore (median) | TTR (median) |\n          |----------------|-----------|---------------------|--------------------|-----------  |\n          | 0 (human)      | 61.8%     | 0.724               | 0.682              | 0.571       |\n          | 1              | 25.3%     | 0.481               | 0.641              | 0.534       |\n          | 2              | 9.7%      | 0.387               | 0.618              | 0.512       |\n          | 3+             | 3.2%      | 0.328               | 0.607              | 0.498       |\n      - title: \"Correlation Matrix (Spearman ρ)\"\n        content: |\n          |                | Pred Depth | AlignScore | TTR     | Hapax Ratio |\n          |----------------|-----------|-----------|---------|-------------|\n          | Pred Depth     | 1.000     | -0.312*** | -0.274***| -0.238***  |\n          | AlignScore     |           | 1.000     | 0.441***| 0.387***   |\n          | TTR            |           |           | 1.000   | 0.812***   |\n          | Hapax Ratio    |           |           |         | 1.000      |\n          *** p < 0.001\n      - title: \"Domain-Specific Depth Distribution\"\n        content: |\n          | CC Domain Category | N docs | Depth-0 % | Depth-1 % | Depth-2+ % |\n          |-------------------|--------|-----------|-----------|------------|\n          | News/journalism   | 12.4K  | 52.1%     | 31.2%     | 16.7%      |\n          | Blogs/forums      | 15.8K  | 58.4%     | 27.1%     | 14.5%      |\n          | Technical docs    | 8.2K   | 71.3%     | 20.4%     | 8.3%       |\n          | Social/UGC        | 13.6K  | 43.8%     | 34.7%     | 21.5%      |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Depth distribution histogram: CC 2025-Jan vs CC 2026-Jan 对比，synthetic content（depth≥1）占比从 34.2% 增至 41.5%，分 depth level 着色。\"\n      - \"AlignScore violin plot by predicted depth: 四个 violin（depth 0-3），中位数递减但分布有大量重叠，标注 ρ=-0.31。\"\n      - \"Type-token ratio vs predicted depth scatter + regression line: 负趋势但散点云宽，depth≥2 后趋于平坦——与 K*=2 饱和一致。\"\n      - \"Classifier confidence calibration curve: predicted depth vs mean confidence，steep drop from depth-0 to depth-1，gradual decline thereafter。\"\n      - \"Domain breakdown stacked bar: 不同 CC 域类别的 depth 分布，social/UGC 的 synthetic 占比最高（56.2%），technical docs 最低（28.7%）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Naturalistic validation 的核心定位是 plausibility check 而非 accuracy validation\n      （无 ground truth）。三个关键信号均符合预期：(1) depth 分布重尾递减，与 K*=2 预测\n      的 \"beyond depth-2 信息已饱和\" 一致（depth-2+ 仅 12.9%，分类器置信度骤降）；\n      (2) 与 AlignScore 和 vocabulary richness 的中等负相关方向正确且量级合理；\n      (3) temporal trend 与 AI content 增长趋势一致。\n\n      Domain breakdown 是额外收获——social/UGC 的 synthetic 占比（56.2%）远高于\n      technical docs（28.7%），反映 LLM 使用模式的域依赖性。这与 C1' 的 domain\n      dependence 主题呼应。\n\n      论文定位：Supporting analysis in Appendix，不作为核心 claim 支柱。主要价值在于\n      展示 K*-aware depth estimation 在实际场景中的行为合理性，以及提供 \"web 上 recursive\n      contamination 正在发生\" 的定量证据——为 motivation section 提供 empirical grounding。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54151,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":54151},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aa62e77c-2cca-4d36-acc6-65f0c92a196e","uuid":"743660ac-95e9-41ed-b2d9-bfb65e06b3b1"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":372970,"duration_api_ms":375107,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。Code 域 Mistral-7B 和 Qwen-7B 均确认 ceiling=2（4/5 domain-competent 模型，\n  仅 Pythia-1.4B 因 code pretraining 不足 K*=1，与 Mistral C4 K*=1 同属 competence failure 模式）。\n  32B 进一步确认 C4 K*=2 不随 scale 变化。Domain ceiling 框架在 4 域 × 6 架构族上无例外成立——\n  所有 \"异常\" 均可被 (domain structure sets ceiling, model competence modulates actual K*) 统一解释。\n  标题级结论：\"K*∈{1,2,3} forming a domain hierarchy — Wiki=1, C4=Code=2, arXiv=3\"。\n  Code 域的加入将 modality 覆盖从 natural language 扩展至 code，4 域覆盖+6 架构族交叉验证\n  构成 EMNLP Main 级别的 empirical evidence。One-wash laundering + domain ceiling 作为\n  memorable takeaway。Claims 无需调整。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B Code Domain Depth Chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_code_mistral7b\"\n    description: >\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 在 Code/Python 域的 prompt-chain depth generation (depth 0-5),\n      scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。验证 Code domain ceiling=2 是否跨 Mistral 架构族成立。\n      核心假设：Mistral 的 code pretraining 赋予其足够的 code domain competence 达到 ceiling=2，\n      尽管其在 C4 上 K*=1。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9485\n        1v2: 0.6893\n        2v3: 0.5274\n        3v4: 0.5121\n        4v5: 0.5058\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0045\n        1v2: 0.0098\n        2v3: 0.0112\n        3v4: 0.0095\n        4v5: 0.0078\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.0718\n        1v2: 0.0392\n        2v3: 0.0035\n        3v4: 0.0028\n        4v5: 0.0026\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {ci_lower: 0.9421, ci_upper: 0.9549, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {ci_lower: 0.6712, ci_upper: 0.7074, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {ci_lower: 0.5139, ci_upper: 0.5409, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {ci_lower: 0.4992, ci_upper: 0.5250, perm_p: 0.0124}\n        4v5: {ci_lower: 0.4947, ci_upper: 0.5169, perm_p: 0.0893}\n      jsd_cliff_ratio_1v2_to_2v3: 11.2\n      ordinal_mae: 1.218\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.349\n      top_features: [freq_entropy, surp_d1_mean, surp_d2_mean, surp_std, surp_d1_skew]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B 在 C4 上 K*=1（web text domain competence 不足，one-wash），在 arXiv 上 K*=3\n      （academic text competence 充分达 ceiling）。Code 域 ceiling=2，而 Mistral 系列在 code\n      benchmarks 上表现强劲（HumanEval ~30-40%），其 code pretraining 数据充分赋予 Code domain\n      competence，使其能达到 ceiling=2。这是 domain ceiling 框架的关键预测：同一模型在三个域给出\n      三个不同 K*（C4=1, Code=2, arXiv=3），完美映射 domain hierarchy。\n\n      1v2 AUC ~0.69 的具体水平理据：(1) 高于 C4 域的 ~0.59（Code 域的结构化特征——syntax trees,\n      indentation, API patterns——提供更强的 generation-distinguishing signal），(2) 略低于\n      Qwen-1.5B Code(0.738) 和 LLaMA-8B Code(0.739)——Mistral 的 code generation 足够好以达\n      ceiling，但其 web text training emphasis 使得 code-specific depth signal 略弱于\n      code-specialized 模型；(3) CI lower=0.671 远超 θ=0.60，判定 robust。\n\n      JSD cliff 在 1v2→2v3（0.039→0.0035, 11.2x collapse）与 Qwen-1.5B Code(11.7x) 和\n      LLaMA-8B Code(13.5x) 一致，确认 Code 域特有的 cliff 位置——不同于 C4 的 0v1→1v2 cliff，\n      说明 domain structure 不仅决定 K* 值还影响信号衰减模式。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Mistral-7B Code Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap CI\"\n        content: |\n          | Pair | AUC    | 95% CI          | > θ=0.60?  | JSD     | perm_p |\n          |------|--------|-----------------|------------|---------|--------|\n          | 0v1  | 0.9485 | [0.942, 0.955]  | ✅         | 0.0718  | <0.001 |\n          | 1v2  | 0.6893 | [0.671, 0.707]  | ✅ +7.1pp  | 0.0392  | <0.001 |\n          | 2v3  | 0.5274 | [0.514, 0.541]  | ❌         | 0.0035  | <0.001 |\n          | 3v4  | 0.5121 | [0.499, 0.525]  | ❌         | 0.0028  | 0.012  |\n          | 4v5  | 0.5058 | [0.495, 0.517]  | ❌         | 0.0026  | 0.089  |\n      - title: \"Code Domain Cross-Model Summary (updated with Mistral-7B)\"\n        content: |\n          | Model       | Family   | K* | 1v2 AUC | JSD cliff ratio | Code competent? |\n          |-------------|----------|----|---------|-----------------|-----------------|\n          | Qwen-1.5B   | Qwen     | 2  | 0.7382  | 11.7x           | ✅               |\n          | LLaMA-8B    | LLaMA    | 2  | 0.7394  | 13.5x           | ✅               |\n          | Mistral-7B  | Mistral  | 2  | 0.6893  | 11.2x           | ✅               |\n          | Qwen-7B     | Qwen     | 2  | 0.7223  | 12.3x           | ✅ (predicted)   |\n          | Pythia-1.4B | GPT-NeoX | 1  | 0.5983  | 2.2x            | ❌ (The Pile)    |\n      - title: \"Mistral-7B Cross-Domain K* Ladder\"\n        content: |\n          | Domain  | K*  | 1v2 AUC | Domain Ceiling | Competence? |\n          |---------|-----|---------|----------------|-------------|\n          | C4      | 1   | 0.5935  | 2              | ❌ (one-wash)|\n          | Code    | 2   | 0.6893  | 2              | ✅           |\n          | arXiv   | 3   | 0.6275  | 3              | ✅           |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Mistral-7B cross-domain K* bar chart: 三柱图 C4(K*=1), Code(K*=2), arXiv(K*=3)，完美阶梯。Domain ceiling 用虚线标注，Mistral 在 C4 未达 ceiling 用不同色标。\"\n      - \"Code domain JSD cliff overlay: 5 个模型的 log(JSD) vs depth pair 曲线叠加，4/5 在 1v2→2v3 呈 >10x collapse，Pythia 无明显 cliff。\"\n      - \"Code 1v2 AUC distribution: 5 个模型的 bootstrap AUC distribution violin plot，4 个的整体分布在 θ=0.60 上方，Pythia 跨越 θ 线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mistral-7B Code K*=2 是 domain ceiling 框架的决定性证据之一。它提供了论文中最强的单模型\n      cross-domain argument：同一模型在三个域分别给出 K*={1,2,3}，完美对应域复杂度阶梯。C4\n      上的 one-wash (K*=1) 不是 model-level limitation——它是 domain-specific competence gap\n      在 domain ceiling 框架下的自然结果。Code 域的 code pretraining \"rescue\" Mistral from\n      one-wash，正如 arXiv 的结构化特征 \"rescue\" 所有 domain-competent 模型至 K*=3。\n\n      具体对论文的意义：(1) Mistral 成为唯一跨三个 K* 值的模型，极具说服力；(2) Code 域\n      现在有 3 个架构族（Qwen, LLaMA, Mistral）确认 ceiling=2，加上 Pythia 的 competence\n      failure，构成完整的 domain ceiling 叙事；(3) 1v2 AUC=0.689 虽低于 Qwen/LLaMA 的\n      ~0.74，但 CI lower=0.671 远超 θ，判定 unambiguous。\n\n  - name: \"Qwen-7B Code Domain Depth Chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_code_qwen7b\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B 在 Code/Python 域的 prompt-chain depth generation (depth 0-5),\n      scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。验证同家族 scale-up 后 Code K*=2 一致性，排除 Qwen-1.5B Code\n      结果是 small-model artifact 的可能。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9401\n        1v2: 0.7223\n        2v3: 0.5312\n        3v4: 0.5088\n        4v5: 0.5047\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0052\n        1v2: 0.0089\n        2v3: 0.0103\n        3v4: 0.0087\n        4v5: 0.0071\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.0748\n        1v2: 0.0418\n        2v3: 0.0034\n        3v4: 0.0027\n        4v5: 0.0024\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {ci_lower: 0.9325, ci_upper: 0.9477, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {ci_lower: 0.7048, ci_upper: 0.7398, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {ci_lower: 0.5175, ci_upper: 0.5449, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {ci_lower: 0.4968, ci_upper: 0.5208, perm_p: 0.0341}\n        4v5: {ci_lower: 0.4943, ci_upper: 0.5151, perm_p: 0.1206}\n      jsd_cliff_ratio_1v2_to_2v3: 12.3\n      ordinal_mae: 1.193\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.356\n      top_features: [freq_entropy, surp_d1_mean, surp_d2_mean, surp_std, surp_d1_skew]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-7B 与 Qwen-1.5B 同属 Qwen 家族，code generation 能力随 scale 提升（Qwen2.5-7B\n      在 HumanEval 上显著优于 1.5B）。域 ceiling=2 由 Code 的 domain structure 设定，不受\n      model scale 影响——这已在 C4 域的 Qwen-1.5B(K*=2) vs Qwen-7B(K*=2) 上验证。\n\n      1v2 AUC ~0.722 的水平理据：(1) 与 Qwen-1.5B Code(0.738) 接近但略低——7B 的更强 code\n      generation（更自然的语法、更准确的 API 使用、更好的 variable naming）使 depth-1 vs depth-2\n      的差异略微缩小（第一代生成已更接近 original），但 K* boundary 信号仍充分；(2) 与 LLaMA-8B\n      Code(0.739) 和 Mistral-7B Code(predicted 0.689) 处于同一量级，但反映 Qwen 家族在\n      code 上的更强 competence（vs Mistral 的相对弱势）；(3) CI lower=0.705 远超 θ=0.60。\n\n      JSD cliff 12.3x（0.042→0.0034）与 family 内 Qwen-1.5B(11.7x) 一致，确认 cliff\n      position 是 domain property 而非 model property。0v1 AUC=0.940 低于 Qwen-1.5B(0.939)\n      是噪声范围内——同家族 cross-scorer 评分下 0v1 高度稳定。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Qwen-7B Code Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap CI\"\n        content: |\n          | Pair | AUC    | 95% CI          | > θ=0.60?  | JSD     | perm_p |\n          |------|--------|-----------------|------------|---------|--------|\n          | 0v1  | 0.9401 | [0.933, 0.948]  | ✅         | 0.0748  | <0.001 |\n          | 1v2  | 0.7223 | [0.705, 0.740]  | ✅ +10.5pp | 0.0418  | <0.001 |\n          | 2v3  | 0.5312 | [0.518, 0.545]  | ❌         | 0.0034  | <0.001 |\n          | 3v4  | 0.5088 | [0.497, 0.521]  | ❌         | 0.0027  | 0.034  |\n          | 4v5  | 0.5047 | [0.494, 0.515]  | ❌         | 0.0024  | 0.121  |\n      - title: \"Qwen Family Code Domain Scale Invariance\"\n        content: |\n          | Model     | Scale | K* | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | JSD cliff | Δ1v2 vs 1.5B |\n          |-----------|-------|----|---------|---------|-----------|--------------|\n          | Qwen-1.5B | 1.5B  | 2  | 0.7382  | 0.5300  | 11.7x     | baseline     |\n          | Qwen-7B   | 7B    | 2  | 0.7223  | 0.5312  | 12.3x     | -1.6pp       |\n      - title: \"Qwen-7B Cross-Domain Consistency\"\n        content: |\n          | Domain | K* | 1v2 AUC | Domain Ceiling | Consistent? |\n          |--------|----|---------|----------------|-------------|\n          | C4     | 2  | 0.6178  | 2              | ✅ (at ceiling) |\n          | Code   | 2  | 0.7223  | 2              | ✅ (at ceiling) |\n          | arXiv  | 3  | 0.6255  | 3              | ✅ (at ceiling) |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Qwen 1.5B vs 7B Code AUC curve overlay: 两条曲线几乎重叠，K* boundary 位置完全一致，展示 scale invariance。\"\n      - \"Qwen-7B cross-domain grouped bar chart: C4, Code, arXiv 三域的 pairwise AUC 并排展示，Code 与 C4 同 K*=2 但 1v2 AUC 更高。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen-7B Code K*=2 提供两重证据：(1) 同家族 scale invariance——1.5B 和 7B 在 Code 域\n      K* 完全一致，1v2 AUC 差异仅 1.6pp（噪声范围），确认 K* 不是 small-model artifact；\n      (2) 单模型跨域一致性——Qwen-7B 在 C4(K*=2), Code(K*=2), arXiv(K*=3) 三域均达到\n      domain ceiling，是 domain ceiling 框架的另一个完美案例。\n\n      Code 域 1v2 AUC(0.722) 显著高于 C4 域(0.618)，尽管两者 K*=2。这反映 Code 的\n      结构化特征（syntax, indentation）在 depth-1 vs depth-2 的辨别力更强，但仍在\n      depth-2 之后饱和。这一差异进一步证明 JSD cliff position 和 signal strength 是\n      domain-dependent 的，即使 K* 相同。\n\n  - name: \"Qwen2.5-32B C4 Scale Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_32b_c4\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-32B 在 C4 web text 上的 depth chain generation (depth 0-5),\n      scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。将 C4 域的 model scale coverage 从 1B-14B 扩展至 32B，\n      验证 K*=2 不随 scale 变化的核心论点。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9487\n        1v2: 0.6152\n        2v3: 0.5438\n        3v4: 0.5192\n        4v5: 0.5108\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0042\n        1v2: 0.0078\n        2v3: 0.0065\n        3v4: 0.0091\n        4v5: 0.0072\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.0965\n        1v2: 0.0096\n        2v3: 0.0055\n        3v4: 0.0040\n        4v5: 0.0032\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {ci_lower: 0.9422, ci_upper: 0.9552, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {ci_lower: 0.6058, ci_upper: 0.6246, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {ci_lower: 0.5341, ci_upper: 0.5535, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {ci_lower: 0.5069, ci_upper: 0.5315, perm_p: 0.0008}\n        4v5: {ci_lower: 0.5003, ci_upper: 0.5213, perm_p: 0.0321}\n      ordinal_mae: 1.239\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.347\n      top_features: [freq_entropy, surp_d1_skew, surp_std, surp_d1_mean, surp_d2_mean]\n    result_rationale: >\n      C4 域 K*=2 已在 8 个 model configurations（1B-14B, 5 architectures）中确认。32B\n      延续这一模式的机制性理由：\n\n      (1) K* ceiling 由 C4 web text 的 domain structure 设定——C4 是 homogeneous web crawl\n      数据，缺乏 arXiv 那样的结构化标记（LaTeX, citations）提供额外 depth signal。Domain\n      structure 不因 model scale 改变，因此 ceiling=2 持续成立。\n\n      (2) 1v2 AUC ~0.615 处于已观测范围 [0.611, 0.654] 内。Qwen 家族 C4 数据：\n      1.5B=0.626, 7B=0.618, 14B=0.621——无系统 scale 趋势，32B 预计类似。略低于 1.5B 是\n      因为更大模型的 generation 更 \"natural\"（词汇分布、perplexity 更接近 human text），\n      depth-1 vs depth-2 的特征差异略微缩小，但 domain ceiling 确保信号仍在 θ 以上。\n\n      (3) 0v1 AUC ~0.949——随 scale 增大 binary detection 信号缓慢减弱（Qwen 系列：\n      1.5B=0.987, 7B=0.964, 14B=0.960, 32B≈0.949），但仍极强。这反映 larger models 的\n      generation 更接近 human text（0v1 gap 缩小），但这是 binary detection 的变化，\n      不影响 K* boundary pair 的判定。\n\n      (4) CI lower=0.606 > θ=0.60，marginally robust（~0.6pp headroom），与 Qwen-1.5B\n      cont(CI lower=0.602) 和 LLaMA-8B(CI lower=0.603) 类似——C4 域 boundary pair 信号\n      本身就在 θ 附近，这是 domain structure 的固有特征而非统计 weakness。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Qwen2.5-32B C4 Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap CI\"\n        content: |\n          | Pair | AUC    | 95% CI          | > θ=0.60?  | JSD     | perm_p |\n          |------|--------|-----------------|------------|---------|--------|\n          | 0v1  | 0.9487 | [0.942, 0.955]  | ✅         | 0.0965  | <0.001 |\n          | 1v2  | 0.6152 | [0.606, 0.625]  | ✅ +0.6pp  | 0.0096  | <0.001 |\n          | 2v3  | 0.5438 | [0.534, 0.554]  | ❌         | 0.0055  | <0.001 |\n          | 3v4  | 0.5192 | [0.507, 0.532]  | ❌         | 0.0040  | <0.001 |\n          | 4v5  | 0.5108 | [0.500, 0.521]  | ❌         | 0.0032  | 0.032  |\n      - title: \"C4 Domain K* across Full Model Scale Range (1B-32B)\"\n        content: |\n          | Model       | Scale | Family   | K* | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | 0v1 AUC |\n          |-------------|-------|----------|----|---------|----------|---------|\n          | OLMo-1B     | 1B    | OLMo     | 2  | 0.6145  | 0.6045   | 0.997   |\n          | Pythia-1.4B | 1.4B  | GPT-NeoX | 2  | 0.6539  | 0.6454   | 0.993   |\n          | Qwen-1.5B   | 1.5B  | Qwen     | 2  | 0.6262  | 0.6168   | 0.987   |\n          | Qwen-7B     | 7B    | Qwen     | 2  | 0.6178  | 0.6079   | 0.964   |\n          | LLaMA-8B    | 8B    | LLaMA    | 2  | 0.6123  | 0.6028   | 0.923   |\n          | Mistral-7B  | 7B    | Mistral  | 1  | 0.5935  | 0.5835   | 0.984   |\n          | Qwen-14B    | 14B   | Qwen     | 2  | 0.6210  | 0.6119   | 0.960   |\n          | Qwen-32B    | 32B   | Qwen     | 2  | 0.6152  | 0.6058   | 0.949   |\n      - title: \"Scale Trend: 0v1 AUC Decay\"\n        content: |\n          | Scale bucket | Mean 0v1 AUC | Mean 1v2 AUC | K* |\n          |-------------|-------------|-------------|-----|\n          | 1-1.5B      | 0.992       | 0.631       | 2   |\n          | 7-8B        | 0.957       | 0.614       | 2*  |\n          | 14-32B      | 0.954       | 0.618       | 2   |\n          * Mistral excluded (K*=1, competence failure)\n    figures_description:\n      - \"log(params) vs 1v2 AUC scatter: 水平线 θ=0.60，所有点（除 Mistral）在 θ 上方，1v2 AUC 无系统 scale 趋势（r²<0.05），论证 K* 是 domain property。\"\n      - \"log(params) vs 0v1 AUC scatter: 缓慢负趋势，从 ~0.99(1B) 到 ~0.95(32B)，标注 '32B generation 更接近 human text，但 binary detection 仍 trivial (AUC>0.94)'。\"\n      - \"32B 的 pairwise AUC 曲线与 14B overlay: 几乎完全重叠，1v2 几乎相同。\"\n    analysis: >\n      32B 结果将 C4 K*=2 的 model scale coverage 从 14B 推至 32B（覆盖 1B-32B, 32x\n      scale range），是回应审稿人 concern \"只基于小模型\" 的直接证据。1v2 AUC=0.615\n      在已观测范围内，CI lower=0.606 > θ=0.60，K*=2 判定成立但 marginal（这是 C4 域\n      的固有特征，不是统计问题）。\n\n      0v1 AUC 的 scale decay（0.997→0.949 across 1B-32B）是有趣的附带发现：larger\n      models 的 first-generation text 更接近 human text，binary detection 逐渐变难。\n      但关键是这不影响 K*——1v2 boundary pair 的信号不随 scale 系统变化。这一解耦\n      进一步支持 K* 由 domain structure 决定的论点。\n\n      对论文的意义：scale coverage 扩展到 32B 后，\"仅限小模型\" 的 concern 大幅\n      缓解。DPI 理论保证 K* 对任意规模存在，实证覆盖 1B-32B 是 reasonable empirical\n      support。70B+ 可留为 future work。\n\n  - name: \"Naturalistic Common Crawl Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 随机样本做 depth prediction，与 AlignScore\n      和独立 vocabulary richness (type-token ratio, hapax legomena ratio) 做 correlation。\n      验证 K*-aware depth estimation 在无 ground truth 的野外数据上的行为合理性。\n    expected_results:\n      n_documents: 50000\n      depth_distribution:\n        predicted_depth_0_pct: 61.8\n        predicted_depth_1_pct: 25.3\n        predicted_depth_2_pct: 9.7\n        predicted_depth_3_plus_pct: 3.2\n      correlations:\n        alignscore_vs_predicted_depth:\n          spearman_rho: -0.312\n          p_value: \"<1e-50\"\n          interpretation: \"deeper generations show lower semantic coherence\"\n        vocab_richness_ttr_vs_predicted_depth:\n          spearman_rho: -0.274\n          p_value: \"<1e-40\"\n          interpretation: \"vocabulary diversity decreases with generation depth\"\n        hapax_ratio_vs_predicted_depth:\n          spearman_rho: -0.238\n          p_value: \"<1e-30\"\n          interpretation: \"rare word usage decreases with depth\"\n        alignscore_vs_ttr:\n          spearman_rho: 0.441\n          p_value: \"<1e-80\"\n      classifier_confidence_by_depth:\n        depth_0_mean_prob: 0.724\n        depth_1_mean_prob: 0.481\n        depth_2_mean_prob: 0.387\n        depth_3_plus_mean_prob: 0.328\n      temporal_comparison:\n        cc_2025_jan_synthetic_pct: 34.2\n        cc_2026_jan_synthetic_pct: 41.5\n        delta_pp: 7.3\n      domain_breakdown:\n        news_sites_depth0_pct: 52.1\n        blog_forums_depth0_pct: 58.4\n        tech_docs_depth0_pct: 71.3\n        social_media_depth0_pct: 43.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Common Crawl 的野外 depth 分布预测基于以下推理链：\n\n      (1) Depth 分布呈重尾递减（~62% depth-0, ~25% depth-1, ~10% depth-2, ~3% depth-3+）。\n      理由：web 上 LLM-generated content 的主要来源是 single-pass generation（SEO content,\n      chatbot responses, AI writing assistants），这些对应 depth-1。真正的递归生成（AI 生成\n      内容被再次用于 AI 生成）较少发生——需要特定 pipeline（如 synthetic data augmentation\n      循环），且多数此类 pipeline 不超过 2-3 轮。Depth-0 仍占主体（>60%）反映 web 上\n      human-written content 的持续主导地位。\n\n      (2) AlignScore 与 predicted depth 的中等负相关（ρ~-0.31）。理由：generation 过程中\n      的 information loss 导致语义漂移——deeper generations 偏离 original 主题、引入\n      hallucinations、丢失 nuanced arguments。但相关性只是中等，因为：(a) CC 是多域混合，\n      不同域的 K* 不同，depth 预测器在 wiki-like 内容上有 K*=1 限制；(b) 低质量 human\n      text（depth-0 但 AlignScore 低）和高质量 AI text（depth-1 但 AlignScore 高）\n      产生噪声；(c) depth 预测器可能在 OOD 域上 miscalibrate。\n\n      (3) Vocabulary richness 与 depth 的负相关（ρ~-0.27）。理由：model collapse 的\n      微观表征——recursive generation 收敛 vocabulary distribution，减少 rare words\n      (hapax legomena)，降低 type-token ratio。这是 information-theoretic 的必然结果\n      (DPI)，但在单文档粒度上信号较弱。\n\n      (4) 分类器置信度随 depth 骤降（0.72→0.48→0.39→0.33）。理由：K*=2 的信息论预期\n      ——depth-0 判定高置信（binary detection trivial），depth-1 中等置信（仍有明确\n      generation artifact），depth-2 低置信（接近 K* boundary，信号饱和），depth-3+\n      极低置信（beyond K*, 实质是随机猜测）。\n\n      (5) Temporal trend（+7.3pp synthetic, 2025→2026）。理由：LLM 使用持续增长，\n      AI-generated content 在 web 上的占比逐年上升，与 industry reports 一致。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Common Crawl Predicted Depth Distribution\"\n        content: |\n          | Predicted Depth | Proportion | Mean Classifier Conf | AlignScore (median) | TTR (median) |\n          |----------------|-----------|---------------------|--------------------|-----------  |\n          | 0 (human)      | 61.8%     | 0.724               | 0.682              | 0.571       |\n          | 1              | 25.3%     | 0.481               | 0.641              | 0.534       |\n          | 2              | 9.7%      | 0.387               | 0.618              | 0.512       |\n          | 3+             | 3.2%      | 0.328               | 0.607              | 0.498       |\n      - title: \"Correlation Matrix (Spearman ρ)\"\n        content: |\n          |                | Pred Depth | AlignScore | TTR     | Hapax Ratio |\n          |----------------|-----------|-----------|---------|-------------|\n          | Pred Depth     | 1.000     | -0.312*** | -0.274***| -0.238***  |\n          | AlignScore     |           | 1.000     | 0.441***| 0.387***   |\n          | TTR            |           |           | 1.000   | 0.812***   |\n          | Hapax Ratio    |           |           |         | 1.000      |\n          *** p < 0.001\n      - title: \"Domain-Specific Depth Distribution\"\n        content: |\n          | CC Domain Category | N docs | Depth-0 % | Depth-1 % | Depth-2+ % |\n          |-------------------|--------|-----------|-----------|------------|\n          | News/journalism   | 12.4K  | 52.1%     | 31.2%     | 16.7%      |\n          | Blogs/forums      | 15.8K  | 58.4%     | 27.1%     | 14.5%      |\n          | Technical docs    | 8.2K   | 71.3%     | 20.4%     | 8.3%       |\n          | Social/UGC        | 13.6K  | 43.8%     | 34.7%     | 21.5%      |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Depth distribution histogram: CC 2025-Jan vs CC 2026-Jan 对比，synthetic content（depth≥1）占比从 34.2% 增至 41.5%，分 depth level 着色。\"\n      - \"AlignScore violin plot by predicted depth: 四个 violin（depth 0-3），中位数递减但分布有大量重叠，标注 ρ=-0.31。\"\n      - \"Type-token ratio vs predicted depth scatter + regression line: 负趋势但散点云宽，depth≥2 后趋于平坦——与 K*=2 饱和一致。\"\n      - \"Classifier confidence calibration curve: predicted depth vs mean confidence，steep drop from depth-0 to depth-1，gradual decline thereafter。\"\n      - \"Domain breakdown stacked bar: 不同 CC 域类别的 depth 分布，social/UGC 的 synthetic 占比最高（56.2%），technical docs 最低（28.7%）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Naturalistic validation 的核心定位是 plausibility check 而非 accuracy validation\n      （无 ground truth）。三个关键信号均符合预期：(1) depth 分布重尾递减，与 K*=2 预测\n      的 \"beyond depth-2 信息已饱和\" 一致（depth-2+ 仅 12.9%，分类器置信度骤降）；\n      (2) 与 AlignScore 和 vocabulary richness 的中等负相关方向正确且量级合理；\n      (3) temporal trend 与 AI content 增长趋势一致。\n\n      Domain breakdown 是额外收获——social/UGC 的 synthetic 占比（56.2%）远高于\n      technical docs（28.7%），反映 LLM 使用模式的域依赖性。这与 C1' 的 domain\n      dependence 主题呼应。\n\n      论文定位：Supporting analysis in Appendix，不作为核心 claim 支柱。主要价值在于\n      展示 K*-aware depth estimation 在实际场景中的行为合理性，以及提供 \"web 上 recursive\n      contamination 正在发生\" 的定量证据——为 motivation section 提供 empirical grounding。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"aa62e77c-2cca-4d36-acc6-65f0c92a196e","total_cost_usd":0.9303122499999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54151,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":21470,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":54151,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":21470,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54151,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":54151},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":49108,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.049187999999999996,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":21470,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":54151,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8811242499999998,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"7b7d74a8-baaa-415e-87c1-38e1b669c59e"}
